        {
          "id": 3334221443,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It is valid to set the FIN flag on the first data being sent, so there could be a corner case in which there is only a data packet from one side that has the FIN flag set and no data from the other side. I would still consider that connection to have data. So perhaps remove the \"|TH_FIN\" part?",
